      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 1,
      "to": 0.34
    },
    {
      "content": "我是你的FPS教练",
      "from": 0.34,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 2,
      "to": 1.44
    },
    {
      "content": "罗恩·兰博·金",
      "from": 1.44,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 3,
      "to": 2.36
    },
    {
      "content": "在这段视频中",
      "from": 2.36,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 4,
      "to": 3.18
    },
    {
      "content": "这是一个基础技能，我认为你应该掌握",
      "from": 10.19,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 5,
      "to": 12.91
    },
    {
      "content": "无论你的技能水平或玩的是什么FPS游戏",
      "from": 12.91,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 6,
      "to": 15.77
    },
    {
      "content": "如果你进行这项训练",
      "from": 15.77,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 7,
      "to": 16.91
    },
    {
      "content": "我保证能帮助你提升稳定性",
      "from": 16.91,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 8,
      "to": 18.85
    },
    {
      "content": "甚至能帮你找到并优化灵敏度",
      "from": 18.85,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 9,
      "to": 21.76
    },
    {
      "content": "并变得更加精准，命中更多头部",
      "from": 21.76,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 10,
      "to": 24.2
    },
    {
      "content": "所以不多说了",
      "from": 24.2,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 11,
      "to": 25.48
    },
    {
      "content": "让我打开Aim Lab",
      "from": 25.48,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 12,
      "to": 27.14
    },
    {
      "content": "然后我会展示如何访问并引导你",
      "from": 27.14,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 13,
      "to": 29.2
    },
    {
      "content": "如何正确进行这项训练",
      "from": 29.2,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 14,
      "to": 31.54
    },
    {
      "content": "打开Aim Lab后",
      "from": 31.54,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 15,
      "to": 33.52
    },
    {
      "content": "前往顶部菜单的Custom选项，然后Workshop，接着在场景中",
      "from": 33.52,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 16,
      "to": 38.71
    },
    {
      "content": "我们搜索Pivot Point Training",
      "from": 38.71,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 17,
      "to": 41.29
    },
    {
      "content": "这里会显示任务Pivot Point Training",
      "from": 41.29,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 18,
      "to": 44.47
    },
    {
      "content": "如我之前所说，这里有四个不同训练区域在四个角落",
      "from": 44.47,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 19,
      "to": 47.83
    },
    {
      "content": "你会看到墙上的数字，表示距离",
      "from": 47.83,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 20,
      "to": 51.19
    },
    {
      "content": "所以你可以训练",
      "from": 51.19,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 21,
      "to": 52.47
    },
    {
      "content": "通过判断这些线条的距离来确定与墙的距离",
      "from": 52.47,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 22,
      "to": 57.57
    },
    {
      "content": "好的",
      "from": 57.57,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 23,
      "to": 57.87
    },
    {
      "content": "首先我们需要确定最大灵敏度范围",
      "from": 57.87,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 24,
      "to": 64.21
    },
    {
      "content": "当手腕向左右弯曲时",
      "from": 64.21,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 25,
      "to": 66.59
    },
    {
      "content": "例如",
      "from": 66.59,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 26,
      "to": 67.41
    },
    {
      "content": "如果我以这里八号位置为中心，对准中间点",
      "from": 67.41,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 27,
      "to": 71.91
    },
    {
      "content": "我要射击这个中间点，甚至在开枪前",
      "from": 71.91,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 28,
      "to": 75.87
    },
    {
      "content": "只需观察从中心点移动时准星能移动多远",
      "from": 75.87,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 29,
      "to": 81.44
    },
    {
      "content": "手腕处于中立位置",
      "from": 81.44,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 30,
      "to": 83.62
    },
    {
      "content": "然后将手腕向右最大弯曲再回到中立",
      "from": 83.62,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 31,
      "to": 88.34
    },
    {
      "content": "接着向左弯曲手腕",
      "from": 88.34,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 32,
      "to": 90.2
    },
    {
      "content": "你会看到准星移动的距离",
      "from": 90.2,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 33,
      "to": 92.19
    },
    {
      "content": "根据我的灵敏度",
      "from": 92.19,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 34,
      "to": 93.91
    },
    {
      "content": "可以看到我稍微超出了这些线条",
      "from": 93.91,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 35,
      "to": 97.23
    },
    {
      "content": "所以我需要稍微后退一点",
      "from": 97.23,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 36,
      "to": 99.87
    },
    {
      "content": "现在要确保手腕左右弯曲时",
      "from": 99.87,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 37,
      "to": 104.05
    },
    {
      "content": "正好击中该区域的边线",
      "from": 104.05,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 38,
      "to": 107.35
    },
    {
      "content": "如你所见",
      "from": 107.35,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 39,
      "to": 108.92
    },
    {
      "content": "我有九到十号",
      "from": 108.92,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 40,
      "to": 111.54
    },
    {
      "content": "快速展示我的设置",
      "from": 111.54,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 41,
      "to": 113.42
    },
    {
      "content": "设置在CS",
      "from": 113.42,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 42,
      "to": 116.02
    },
    {
      "content": "选择《CS:GO》",
      "from": 116.02,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 43,
      "to": 117.92
    },
    {
      "content": "四DPI对应0.7灵敏度",
      "from": 117.92,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 44,
      "to": 120.4
    },
    {
      "content": "五点五灵敏度",
      "from": 120.4,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 45,
      "to": 121.3
    },
    {
      "content": "让你了解我的配置",
      "from": 121.3,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 46,
      "to": 123.08
    },
    {
      "content": "对我而言",
      "from": 123.08,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 47,
      "to": 124.66
    },
    {
      "content": "如果我要练习从中间点转向",
      "from": 124.66,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 48,
      "to": 127.88
    },
    {
      "content": "对",
      "from": 127.88,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 49,
      "to": 128.24
    },
    {
      "content": "所以如果你看向摄像头",
      "from": 128.24,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 50,
      "to": 129.66
    },
    {
      "content": "我正在做的只是左右弯曲手腕",
      "from": 129.66,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 51,
      "to": 132.9
    },
    {
      "content": "我只是在旋转",
      "from": 132.9,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 52,
      "to": 134.34
    },
    {
      "content": "我没有移动手腕",
      "from": 134.34,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 53,
      "to": 136.61
    },
    {
      "content": "所以这只是练习这个任务的两种方法",
      "from": 136.61,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 54,
      "to": 139.39
    },
    {
      "content": "一种是手腕，另一种是前臂",
      "from": 139.39,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 55,
      "to": 141.29
    },
    {
      "content": "稍后我会展示给你们看",
      "from": 141.29,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 56,
      "to": 142.49
    },
    {
      "content": "此时手腕是固定的，我只是在旋转",
      "from": 142.49,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 57,
      "to": 146.0
    },
    {
      "content": "我要射击中间的目标",
      "from": 146.0,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 58,
      "to": 147.38
    },
    {
      "content": "然后你会看到目标随机生成",
      "from": 147.38,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 59,
      "to": 150.08
    },
    {
      "content": "在左右两侧的某个位置",
      "from": 150.08,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 60,
      "to": 151.97
    },
    {
      "content": "我想让你们练习的一种方法",
      "from": 151.97,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 61,
      "to": 153.69
    },
    {
      "content": "当你射击目标时",
      "from": 153.69,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 62,
      "to": 156.25
    },
    {
      "content": "然后反应并射击目标",
      "from": 156.25,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 63,
      "to": 158.49
    },
    {
      "content": "我之前做的一点",
      "from": 158.49,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 64,
      "to": 159.85
    },
    {
      "content": "我有点抢在前面射击",
      "from": 159.85,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 65,
      "to": 162.2
    },
    {
      "content": "在我实际视觉确认目标生成方向前就移动了",
      "from": 162.2,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 66,
      "to": 166.47
    },
    {
      "content": "你可以看到点击中心目标",
      "from": 166.47,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 67,
      "to": 169.23
    },
    {
      "content": "快速甩动并左右最大限度弯曲手腕",
      "from": 169.23,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 68,
      "to": 173.48
    },
    {
      "content": "我需要提醒你们一点",
      "from": 173.48,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 69,
      "to": 175.02
    },
    {
      "content": "不要一直将手腕完全向右压",
      "from": 175.02,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 70,
      "to": 180.54
    },
    {
      "content": "持续这样",
      "from": 180.54,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 71,
      "to": 181.36
    },
    {
      "content": "好的",
      "from": 181.36,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 72,
      "to": 181.82
    },
    {
      "content": "所以要给自己留一点活动空间",
      "from": 181.82,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 73,
      "to": 183.92
    },
    {
      "content": "如果你这样做",
      "from": 183.92,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 74,
      "to": 184.68
    },
    {
      "content": "肯定会导致前臂紧张",
      "from": 184.68,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 75,
      "to": 187.66
    },
    {
      "content": "这能帮助你意识到",
      "from": 187.66,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 76,
      "to": 189.48
    },
    {
      "content": "我的准星左右偏移的可能性或能力",
      "from": 189.48,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 77,
      "to": 193.18
    },
    {
      "content": "当手腕左右弯曲时",
      "from": 193.18,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 78,
      "to": 194.63
    },
    {
      "content": "但你不希望离墙太近",
      "from": 194.63,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 79,
      "to": 198.7
    },
    {
      "content": "导致完全向右压",
      "from": 198.7,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 80,
      "to": 200.62
    },
    {
      "content": "你会感到这种紧张",
      "from": 200.62,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 81,
      "to": 201.74
    },
    {
      "content": "给自己留一点空间",
      "from": 201.74,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 82,
      "to": 203.66
    },
    {
      "content": "你可以这样做",
      "from": 203.66,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 83,
      "to": 204.46
    },
    {
      "content": "就是稍微后退一点",
      "from": 204.46,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 84,
      "to": 206.08
    },
    {
      "content": "现在技术上",
      "from": 206.08,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 85,
      "to": 206.98
    },
    {
      "content": "如果我最大限度向左弯曲手腕",
      "from": 206.98,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 86,
      "to": 209.14
    },
    {
      "content": "会超出范围",
      "from": 209.14,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 87,
      "to": 210.5
    },
    {
      "content": "所以给自己留一点余量避免紧张",
      "from": 210.5,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 88,
      "to": 214.24
    },
    {
      "content": "这是很好的学习方法",
      "from": 214.24,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 89,
      "to": 216.3
    },
    {
      "content": "你知道我的准星在x轴上的移动范围",
      "from": 216.3,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 90,
      "to": 219.92
    },
    {
      "content": "当手腕左右弯曲时",
      "from": 219.92,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 91,
      "to": 221.92
    },
    {
      "content": "然后可以练习不同范围",
      "from": 221.92,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 92,
      "to": 224.12
    },
    {
      "content": "比如",
      "from": 224.12,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 93,
      "to": 224.4
    },
    {
      "content": "如果你想提高灵敏度",
      "from": 224.4,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 94,
      "to": 226.76
    },
    {
      "content": "比如我有一个超高灵敏度墙",
      "from": 226.76,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 95,
      "to": 229.71
    },
    {
      "content": "我可以更大幅度左右弯曲手腕",
      "from": 229.71,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 96,
      "to": 233.63
    },
    {
      "content": "可以自行实验",
      "from": 233.63,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 97,
      "to": 235.62
    },
    {
      "content": "这样你始终清楚",
      "from": 235.62,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 98,
      "to": 237.38
    },
    {
      "content": "好的",
      "from": 237.38,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 99,
      "to": 237.52
    },
    {
      "content": "如果我左右摆动手腕",
      "from": 237.52,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 100,
      "to": 239.12
    },
    {
      "content": "它总是会瞄准这个角度",
      "from": 239.12,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 101,
      "to": 240.84
    },
    {
      "content": "然后你会有一个工作区域",
      "from": 240.84,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 102,
      "to": 243.81
    },
    {
      "content": "或者你会有一个这样的锥形范围，你总能在这个范围内不精准地瞄准",
      "from": 243.81,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 103,
      "to": 248.11
    },
    {
      "content": "所以",
      "from": 248.11,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 104,
      "to": 248.47
    },
    {
      "content": "在我们实验并熟练左右转动后",
      "from": 248.47,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 105,
      "to": 253.13
    },
    {
      "content": "用我们的手腕",
      "from": 253.13,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 106,
      "to": 253.87
    },
    {
      "content": "你可以用手臂做同样的动作",
      "from": 253.87,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 107,
      "to": 255.8
    },
    {
      "content": "我的意思是，我们要固定锚点并转动",
      "from": 255.8,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 108,
      "to": 259.36
    },
    {
      "content": "将前臂贴在桌面上",
      "from": 259.36,
      "location": 2,
